  "estimatedMinutes": 1,
  "statement": "How many pairs of parallel edges, such as \\(\\overline{AB}\\) and \\(\\overline{GH}\\) or \\(\\overline{EH}\\) and \\(\\overline{FG},\\) does a cube have?",
  "answerChoices": [
